<title>COLOMBIA: Avianca 1996 net profit slips.</title>
<headline>Avianca 1996 net profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The net profit of Aerovias Nacionales de Colombia SA (Avianca), Colombia's leading airline, totaled 18.9 billion pesos in 1996, down from 23.5 billion in 1995, the Securities Superintendency said Tuesday.</p>
<p>It gave no further information on the earnings of the airline, which is part of the Julio Mario Santo Domingo conglomerate.</p>
<p>Avianca has called a stockholder meeting for next Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Javier Mozzo, Bogota Newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
